      "text": "The @AustralianArmy Combat Training Centre Jungle Training Wing conducted jungle survival training in 📍 Oyster Bay, Philippines, as part of Exercise Balikatan.\n\nPersonnel from Australia, New Zealand, the Philippines and the United States rotated through the training, developing essential jungle survival skills such as sourcing potable water and conducting live-fire serials.\n\nThe training was led by the Jungle Training Wing, with Filipino soldiers contributing vital local expertise during instructional periods.\n\n#YourADF #AusArmy #StrongerTogether @TeamAFP",
